    <string name="onboarding_title">Welcome to TartaTV</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message">TartaTV is a player for IPTV lists in the Xtream Codes standard — it only plays the content returned by the server whose credentials you provide. There is no built-in catalog and no content of our own.\n\nYour credentials and preferences stay on your device, in encrypted storage. We do not send data to us or to third parties, and we do not use ads or tracking.\n\nBefore continuing, please read the documents below. To use the app you need to agree to the Terms of Use and the Privacy Policy.</string>
